<title>USA: Crane's Movats to have less impact on results.</title>
<headline>Crane's Movats to have less impact on results.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crane Co said on Thursday that its Movats valve and diagnostic business that was acquired in April should have less of an impact on sales and profitability for the remainder of the year due to the seasonality of its business.</p>
<p>Movats contributed $8 million to the company's $102.2 million in second quarter sales, the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
